  StyleBox["boundaryDirection", "TI"]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Source Sans Pro",ExpressionUUID->
  "219f5b20-42b3-cd44-b0e4-a5c6d67f6849"],
 ", then ordered by displacement norm within each group."
}], "Notes",
 CellID->1771703908,ExpressionUUID->"5584cfd2-8ec3-be41-8f31-e01ab9e7e82f"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "The implementation accepts cell associations of lengths ",
